# Free auth keys for the two MVP data sources. Copy to .env and fill in.

# Bizinfo crtfcKey — https://www.bizinfo.go.kr/apiDetail.do?id=bizinfoApi
#   (or menu: 활용정보 > 정책정보 개방). Fill the form (기관명/신청자명/이메일/
#   전화/시스템명/IP-or-URL); key is EMAILED to you. No login required.
BIZINFO_CRTFC_KEY=

# data.go.kr serviceKey — https://www.data.go.kr/data/15125364/openapi.do
#   (search box: "창업진흥원 K-Startup 조회서비스"). Click 활용신청 → instant, copy key.
DATA_GO_KR_SERVICE_KEY=
